@startuml
title UML classes — View the youth report
class DetailedReportsHandler { +YouthAsync(childId): YouthReportDto? }
class YouthReportDto <<record>> { ChildId Name Age? Programs HasAccount }
class YouthLearningDto <<record>> { CompletedLessons TotalLessons Completion? QuizAverage? Badges }
class YouthModuleDto <<record>> { Title Done Total State }
class YouthQuizDto <<record>> { Title BestScore }
class YouthAttendanceSummaryDto <<record>> { Present Late Excused Absent Rate? }
class YouthMentoringDto <<record>> { MentorName? CheckIns LatestOn? LatestEngagement? OpenFlag }
DetailedReportsHandler ..> YouthReportDto
YouthReportDto *-- YouthLearningDto
YouthLearningDto *-- YouthModuleDto
YouthLearningDto *-- YouthQuizDto
YouthReportDto *-- YouthAttendanceSummaryDto
YouthReportDto *-- YouthMentoringDto
@enduml
